        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n0" value="OPEN: Pi power entry; USB power coexistence; sensor supply levels and physical connector views.&#10;A02YYUW is not connected to HC-SR04 trigger/echo pins. Candidate replacement remains unselected.&#10;Camera path, OLED, encoders, PCA9685, GPS/RTK, LiDAR and motion-control interfaces: future / unresolved.&#10;MPU-6050 has no magnetometer. No absolute yaw, odometry or obstacle-avoidance capability is established.&#10;Sources: S04 BOM; S06 research report; owner Uno confirmation; REC-001..038 discrepancy register." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="745" width="1400" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="DRAFT R1 | 2026-11-21 | Dashed links = unresolved/proposed, not an instruction to wire | Technical review pending" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
